---
title: "Sarasota Watersports Blog"
description: "Tips, guides and stories about eFoiling and Seabobbing in Sarasota, Siesta Key and Anna Maria Island from the team at Opua Adventures."
---
<div class="card-grid">
  {% for post in collections.post | reverse %}
    <article class="card">…</article>
  {% endfor %}

  {# Fill the empty spot when the post count is odd #}
  {% if collections.post.length % 2 == 1 %}
    <article class="card card--featured">
      <header class="card__header">
        <h2 class="card__title">Have a question?</h2>
      </header>
      <div class="card__body">
        <p>Ask us about lessons, rentals or group bookings.</p>
      </div>
      <footer class="card__footer">
        <a class="btn btn--accent" href="/opua-adventures-contact/">Contact us</a>
      </footer>
    </article>
  {% endif %}
</div>